# id|name|path|tools|install|run|os|deps
# tools: comma-separated tool names required on PATH (e.g., bun,cargo,ray)
# os: comma-separated values: darwin, linux (leave empty for all)
# deps: comma-separated app ids that should start before this app
atlas-api|Atlas API (SvelteKit)|atlas-api|bun|bun install|bun run dev|darwin,linux|
atlas-browser|Raycast Extension (Atlas Browser)|atlas-browser|bun,ray|bun install|bun run dev|darwin|atlas-api
atlas-picker|CLI (Rust)|atlas-picker|cargo|cargo build|cargo run|darwin,linux|atlas-api
atlas-cli|CLI (atlas command)|atlas-cli|bun|bun install && bun link|atlas help|darwin,linux|
atlas-watchdog|Raycast Script Command|atlas-watchdog|lsof|chmod +x run-atlas-watchdog.sh|./run-atlas-watchdog.sh|darwin|atlas-api
